SUMMARY:Deadline: Paul & Daisy Soros Fellowships for New Americans 2027 (US
  graduate study)
DESCRIPTION:The Paul & Daisy Soros Fellowships for New Americans annually s
 elect 30 fellows based on their potential to make significant contribution
 s to American society\, culture\, and their chosen fields\, across discipl
 ines including the arts.\n\nOrganisation: The Paul & Daisy Soros Fellowshi
 ps for New Americans\nLocation: USA. For immigrants and children of immigr
 ants pursuing graduate or professional study at US institutions.\nAward: U
 p to USD 90\,000 over two years (stipend and tuition support) toward gradu
 ate study\; 30 fellowships awarded annually. No application fee.\nDuration
 : Two years of funding for graduate study\, beginning fall 2027\, plus all
 -expenses-paid attendance at the Fall Conference.\n\nMore: https://pdsoros
 .org/application-process/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium
 =referral
URL:https://pdsoros.org/application-process/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:USA. For immigrants and children of immigrants pursuing graduate o
 r professional study at US institutions.
END:VEVENT
